<p>Concentrate on the battle, ignoring some of the damage you take.</p><p>Improves physical damage reduction by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15%, 21%, 26%, 31%, 35%</acronym> and provides a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">8%, 11%, 14%, 17%, 20%</acronym> chance to shrug off critical damage for 20 turns.</p>